{"id":"5f666640d389933f79bda9f2d426df38e3c06485","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1258094","title":"有没有什么办法让我忘记开梯子的时候，让 Claude 断网？","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"milkleeeeee","excerpt":"Claude - @milkleeeeee - 我今天重启了下电脑，重启前特意把 Claude 桌面版关了，但不知道为什么开启后 Claude 桌面版自动打开了，但这个时候我还没有开梯子，我都看到它显示“App Unavailable”了，感觉我离","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div><p>我今天重启了下电脑，重启前特意把 Claude 桌面版关了，但不知道为什么开启后 Claude 桌面版自动打开了，但这个时候我还没有开梯子，我都看到它显示“App Unavailable”了，感觉我离封号不远了</p>\n<p>所以为了避免下次再次出现这个问题，有没有什么办法让我在忘记开梯子的情况下打开 Claude 的时候，让 Claude 连不上网络？</p>\n</div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n<div id=\"topic-replies\">\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/Claude\"><li></li> Claude</a><a href=\"/tag/断网\"><li></li> 断网</a><a href=\"/tag/网络\"><li></li> 网络</a></P><p><span>72 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-11-19 19:14:11 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18304624\" data-reply-id=\"18304624\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/fdd0/2538/826506_normal.png?m=1787722079\" alt=\"vexify\" data-uid=\"826506\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>2</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>dns 可以解决吧，不开梯子，走的 dns，返回错误 ip，开梯子，才正常的 ip</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    \n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18304627\" data-reply-id=\"18304627\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/f5509b1a5185a3ba32c30b7dece719cd?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"qaz793\" data-uid=\"74452\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>4</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>好像苹果可以</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18304634\" data-reply-id=\"18304634\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4bb4/f3fc/639478_normal.png?m=1792247716\" alt=\"aerAzLNE\" data-uid=\"639478\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>5</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>host 加 127001</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    \n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18304656\" data-reply-id=\"18304656\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/230f01689531b895bc120f015724cf4d?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"uxff\" data-uid=\"277108\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>7</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>专门分配一个 vm，里面开机启动 claude+vpn。甚至可以给 claude 创建一个专有的启动脚本，只要验证 vpn 起来了再启动 claude。</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18304662\" data-reply-id=\"18304662\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/e30cc3f2294a86f1ad2b4a230871c899?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"cs10086\" data-uid=\"218904\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>8</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>唉，gfw 该屏蔽的不屏蔽。如果 gfw 把 claude 家的域名全封了就没事儿了。</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18304673\" data-reply-id=\"18304673\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3384/ace9/9970_normal.png?m=1704764630\" alt=\"terrancesiu\" data-uid=\"9970\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>9</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>包含 kill switch 功能的 vpn 客户端，包括原生的 windows 的 wireguard 客户端。</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18304749\" data-reply-id=\"18304749\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/e30cc3f2294a86f1ad2b4a230871c899?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"cs10086\" data-uid=\"218904\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>10</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>突然想到我的 claude 账号在弹出 portal 认证的前几天也出现过电脑重启，自动打开了 claude app。</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18304764\" data-reply-id=\"18304764\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/71c6/c9b8/388317_normal.png?m=1594708697\" alt=\"helloedison\" data-uid=\"388317\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>11</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>可以安装 Claude cage，彻底将 Claude 运行在虚拟机里面</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18304769\" data-reply-id=\"18304769\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/2402/0b36/507493_normal.png?m=1749088248\" alt=\"DnzJans\" data-uid=\"507493\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>12</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>让 codex 给你做一个启动前检查的程序，程序没打开检查通过，就不启动 claude</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    \n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18304785\" data-reply-id=\"18304785\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/cb7e/d3ff/714531_normal.png?m=1761119463\" alt=\"V2Try\" data-uid=\"714531\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            <div><p><strong><a href=\"/member/V2Try\">V2Try</a></strong></p><p><span title=\"2026-11-18 21:14:16 +08:00\">22h 56m ago via iPhone</span></p></div>\n            <p><span>14</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>很简单，把 Claude 相关的域名写在/etc/hosts 里指向 127.0.0.1，翻墙 app 没开的时候自然访问不到，开了翻墙 app，域名会在代理服务器解析，就能连上。</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    \n    \n\n    \n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18304801\" data-reply-id=\"18304801\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/96ef/6ef5/193799_normal.png?m=1739275402\" alt=\"ik\" data-uid=\"193799\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>17</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>自己把对应域名解析污染掉就行了，或者系统代理一直存在，只是代理服务不启动的话就不通而已。</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18304903\" data-reply-id=\"18304903\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/64d6/6ac2/51170_normal.png?m=1794816486\" alt=\"Tink\" data-uid=\"51170\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            <div><p><strong><a href=\"/member/Tink\">Tink</a></strong></p><p><span title=\"2026-11-18 22:39:16 +08:00\">21h 31m ago via iPhone</span></p></div>\n            <p><span>18</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>没开梯子的时候能连上 claude 服务器吗</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    \n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18305090\" data-reply-id=\"18305090\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/deb712acd36f3f75cf1e04dfbf5babbc?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"tukumij\" data-uid=\"733836\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>20</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>settings 里面设置代理端口（没试过）？或者整个梯子开机自启动的脚本？</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18305095\" data-reply-id=\"18305095\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/bedf/40df/438004_normal.png?m=1786379099\" alt=\"docx\" data-uid=\"438004\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            <div><p><strong><a href=\"/member/docx\">docx</a></strong></p><p><span title=\"2026-11-19 01:38:44 +08:00\">18h 32m ago via iPhone</span></p></div>\n            <p><span>21</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>为什么不换个思路呢，跟随 Claude 进程同步启动代理</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    \n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18305155\" data-reply-id=\"18305155\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/04c7/f37f/12555_normal.png?m=1749107530\" alt=\"x86\" data-uid=\"12555\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            <div><p><strong><a href=\"/member/x86\">x86</a></strong></p><p><span title=\"2026-11-19 06:33:23 +08:00\">13h 37m ago via iPhone</span></p></div>\n            <p><span>23</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>claude 的分流写到 127.0.0.1:7890</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18305190\" data-reply-id=\"18305190\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/1454fdbcf38cee9036b2616e868134d0?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"zhang666\" data-uid=\"745276\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>24</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>全局透明代理</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    \n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18305207\" data-reply-id=\"18305207\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/5737/1e8a/171625_normal.png?m=1794052619\" alt=\"kuse2001\" data-uid=\"171625\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>26</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>magpie 可以给 claude provider 设置代理，代理地址由你的梯子提供，Claude 不会随便上网。只有梯子通的时候才能上。梯子不通或者网络不稳定都没有关系</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    \n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18305354\" data-reply-id=\"18305354\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/f43a82707e213d3b150d36315a450fbb?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"alsas\" data-uid=\"162457\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>28</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>有什么办法让 gfw 把 a/的域名全封了</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18305356\" data-reply-id=\"18305356\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7dbb/e416/374212_normal.png?m=1753759854\" alt=\"idihs\" data-uid=\"374212\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>29</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>TUN，限制某个应用仅能访问某个网卡。</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18305381\" data-reply-id=\"18305381\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/3875f254bd55d885976e51c8f0643573?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"spikedingo\" data-uid=\"191143\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>30</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <div><p>我刚好本地研究完了这个，已经在用了</p><p>用 macOS 自带的防火墙 pf，规则一直挂在 Wi-Fi 和网线这些物理网卡上。Clash 的虚拟网卡 utun 不在这份名单里。<br>然后加三条规则：<br>1. 去局域网的包放行。<br>2. root 发出的 TCP/UDP 放行。Clash 核心是 root，所以它还能连节点。<br>3. 其余从物理网卡出去的包全部丢掉。<br>普通软件出外网只能走 utun。Clash 开着，流量从 utun 进隧道；Clash 一关，utun 没了，物理网卡上又只剩第 3 条，包就出不去等于断网了。<br>另有一个开机启动的 LaunchDaemon，每 30 秒检查一次：pf 开着、这组规则还在。被清掉就重新装上。</p></div>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    \n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18305424\" data-reply-id=\"18305424\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a97d/a629/107_normal.png?m=1764291462\" alt=\"ratazzi\" data-uid=\"107\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>32</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>就改 hosts, 然后代理软件设置不读 hosts</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    \n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18305463\" data-reply-id=\"18305463\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/7f037dd8ed9fa24613f146f398c68a25?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"torlee\" data-uid=\"746356\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>34</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>antify，可以把 app 的流量全走代理，代理没开直接 block</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18305478\" data-reply-id=\"18305478\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/c581/4bff/747972_normal.png?m=1792420365\" alt=\"BruceWooong\" data-uid=\"747972\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>35</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>我也经常这样，晚上走的时候忘记关 claude 了，第二天早上来发现节点超时了，那我的 claude 岂不是暴露了一晚上</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18305501\" data-reply-id=\"18305501\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/876e/49c8/625203_normal.png?m=1741597141\" alt=\"Bejita\" data-uid=\"625203\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>36</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>让 ai 帮你搞定这个事情</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    \n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18305639\" data-reply-id=\"18305639\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/dc62/47ff/71403_normal.png?m=1429072930\" alt=\"mgcnrx11\" data-uid=\"71403\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>38</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <div><p>最主要还是放着代理 APP 闪退啊，一闪退全机都流量都变 direct。感觉最靠谱的都是不能依赖 app 做的方案。</p><p>pf 防火墙规则，或者/etc/hosts 把域名指向 127.0.0.1 ，系统级别的拦截才稳妥</p></div>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18305942\" data-reply-id=\"18305942\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3598/81dd/145501_normal.png?m=1766111462\" alt=\"mikaelson\" data-uid=\"145501\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>39</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>macos 的话，我常年开着梯子，配合这个 antify</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    \n    \n\n    \n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18305966\" data-reply-id=\"18305966\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/cfab16826070e73d521eb179b4778d9e?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"aslehx\" data-uid=\"739256\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>42</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>用 macOS 自带的 PF 防火墙给整台机器做断流保护<br><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/p4Ht1aj.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/p4Ht1aj.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a></p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    \n    \n\n    \n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18306042\" data-reply-id=\"18306042\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\